  "rules": [
    "Only the alp token family is valid for Alpin screens.",
    "alp-well is the page canvas, #FFFFFF the card. No shadows on cards, no gradients anywhere.",
    "alp-ink is used for text, selected controls and primary actions; page and card backgrounds use their own tokens.",
    "Metric colours (sleep/recovery/strain/pulse/food) appear only on data and their -tint pairs.",
    "alp-action only on actionable elements.",
    "Dark mode swaps every alp token for its alp-dark twin, including -tint pairs; light tints never appear on dark surfaces.",
    "Metric colour on text ≤ 14 px uses the -text variant (≥ 4.5:1 on white); in dark mode the plain dark metric colour already passes."
  ],
